(Phnom Penh): Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, stated that the operating procedures for the recruitment competition for ministries and institutions, ensuring the public's trust, that is, "proudly failed" and the selection of technical officers. Professional officers meet the requirements for the target.
This statement of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet was made on the afternoon of Thursday, April 4, 2024, on the occasion that Samdech presided over the ceremony. Closing the meeting to review the work in 2023 and raise the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Public Function.
On that occasion, Samdech President Hun Manet instructed the Ministry of Public Function and other stakeholders to continue to pay attention and participate in supporting and implementing in improving the recruitment of officials to serve in the public administration with merit, transparency, justice, environment and efficiency. The duration of the competition for the selection of civil servants for which the Royal Government has given permission.
"Based on the standard operating procedures for the recruitment of officials for ministries and institutions, ensuring the public's trust, that is," proudly, relentlessly, "and promoting the organization and placement. To implement the legal documents and the selection and management of technical officers, professional officers who ensure the fulfillment of requirements, the fulfillment must be maintained.
Samdech Hun Sen said that the Ministry of Public Works has been recognized for playing an important role in supporting and fulfilling the functions of ministries and institutions and sub-national administrations, as well as supporting key government reforms, including Decentralization and deconcentration reform, reform of public financial management and reform of priority areas of the Royal Government, such as education and health.
In this seventh mandate, Samdech Hun Sen emphasized that the work of public administration reform is still an important priority of the Royal Government of Cambodia, and the Ministry of Public Works continues to play a key role in this work to continue to prioritize and provide Focus more on reform work.
As highlighted by Samdech Hun Sen, President Hun Manet further instructed the Ministry of Public Service to work hard to achieve a series of remarkable achievements by supporting the management and development of the public service sector. National and sub-national levels.
This statement was made by the President at the closing ceremony of the meeting to review the work in 2023 and raise the direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Public Function on the afternoon of April 4, 2024.
On that occasion, the President said that the goal we set is the need that we need to meet, but meet the principles and indicators that we want, how many people need to meet the actual needs based on functional analysis.
Samdech continued that the request for officials to work at the sub-national level must ensure the goals for the sub-national level and keep working consistently. In the case of ministries and institutions at the national level, it is necessary to have clear requirements and clear goals before requesting the recruitment of additional officials, so it is necessary to analyze the requirements first, if there is no clear analysis and argument, the prince will not allow it.
He also stated that the desire for such conditions is not a ban on the recruitment of new officials, but a formula for implementing the recruitment of new officials, and the Royal Government will evaluate these formulas within three months. 6 months or 1 year.
On the other hand, the President also advised the state institutions to use the existing officials as much as possible before deciding to recruit new officials, including full-time civil servants, contract officials, technical officers and so on.
The Prime Minister reiterated that "this term is a period of grassroots development, an orientation period for the Royal Government of Cambodia, as well as ministries and institutions that are the staff of the Royal Government." The King issues a Royal Decree and confirms the position of Director, Deputy Director and Assistant to the Cabinet of Mr. Ouch Borith, Second Vice President of the Senate
Prior to the announcement of the promotion, the directors of each specialized department in the capitals and provinces had the same status as the deputy directors of the departments. The promotion was confirmed by the Prime Minister as an encouragement, while the specialized departments in the provincial capitals have more responsibilities.
The speech of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet was made on the occasion of presiding over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting and the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Public Function on the afternoon of April 4, 2024.
Samdech stressed that there is nothing wrong with the promotion of the capital-provincial department, and this promotion is to encourage more officials to get jobs and promote authority and responsibility.
The Prime Minister further stated that this installation also does not affect the command hierarchy in the provincial capital.
Samdech President Hun Manet stated that the proposal to appoint sub-national officials as well as the director of the specialized department must be submitted from the bottom up to the province to the Ministry of specialized institutions.
Samdech continued that for the three types of armed forces, including the provincial police commissioner, the provincial military and the provincial military, were also given the same incentives as the civil service department. The King issues a Royal Decree and confers the positions of 7 Deputy Chiefs and Deputy Assistants of the Cabinet of Mr. Prak Sokhon, First Vice President of the Senate
