Two online dating couples who swindled hundreds of millions of dollars in Kampong Cham and some capitals have been arrested by the military.
(Phnom Penh-Kampong Cham): The Armed Forces have arrested two couples who cheated millions of dollars online in Kampong Cham and the provincial capitals, following the orders of General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander-in-Chief. Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Commander of the National Gendarmerie.
Brigadier General So Savoeun, Commander of Kampong Cham Provincial Gendarmerie, told Fresh News on the afternoon of April 4, 2024 that according to the order of General Sao Sokha and Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham, under the coordination of Kampong Cham Provincial Prosecutor. In Phnom Penh, the Armed Forces investigated an online tungsten case in which the master owed tens of thousands of tungsten children worth millions of dollars and escaped.
Brigadier General So Savoeun further stated that on April 3, 2024, at 13:40, the Kampong Cham Provincial Gendarmerie expanded its jurisdiction in cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie led by Lieutenant Colonel Sem Kheang, Director of the Research Department. And cracked down on the provincial military police to go down to the Boeung Tumpun condominium in Kbal Tumnup village, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh, by arresting the couple online.
According to the Commander, the couple was arrested on April 2, 2024 in connection with the arrest warrant issued by Seng Rithy, Deputy Prosecutor of Kampong Cham Provincial Court. On trust and fraud (Tong Tin online).
Myanmar has been in turmoil since the military overthrew Aung San Suu Kyi-elected government in 2021. Conflict between government forces, the military and the anti-war resistance movement has turned Myanmar into one of the most mine-rich countries in the world. UNICEF claimed that landmines and other explosives were being used indiscriminately by both sides in the face of escalating conflict.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends a Letter of Thanks to Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet for Congratulating Samdech on the Occupation of President of the Senate for the 5th Mandate
Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen stated in the full message as follows:
Samdech Moha Bovathibodi, a dear friend! First of all, I would like to express my heartfelt thanks for receiving the congratulatory message and best wishes from the Supreme Master Ching Hai to my wife and family on the occasion of my first session of the Senate. 5th Legislature unanimously elected "President of the Senate" of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
At the same time, my wife and I would like to pray to the sacred objects everywhere, especially the merits of the three jewels of Preah Ratanatray Keo, to nurture and take care of His Majesty the King Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, and Lok Chumteav and his beloved sons and daughters. With the four blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength, do not forget. Please accept, Sir, the assurances of my highest consideration.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Delivers a Message of Thanks to His Majesty the King for Congratulating His Majesty the King on His Occupation
Once again, I, the King, allow you to bow down to the Lord, bless you, Your Majesty, the Prince of Life on the Rock, Your Majesty the King possesses the four blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength, do not waste it. May Your Majesty, the Prince of Life on the Rock, be the most revered deity, may the King receive the highest development and the highest gratitude for me.
The Ministry of Rural Development continues to disseminate the meeting to summarize the work results in 2023 on its work direction for 2024 in Oddar Meanchey province
(Oddar Meanchey): Mr. Yim Chung, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development, on the morning of April 4, 2024, held a meeting to disseminate the 2023 work review meeting on the 2024 work direction of the Ministry of Rural Development in Oddar Meanchey province. .
The ceremony was held at the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Department of Rural Development with the participation of the Deputy Governor on behalf of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Governor, as well as officials from various relevant institutions.
On this occasion, Mr. Heng Sok Eng, Director of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Department of Rural Development, presented the report of the meeting to summarize the work results of 2023, the work direction of 2024 of the Ministry of Rural Development, as well as some work results of the Department of Rural Development. Oddar Meanchey province achieved.
The Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development stated that in the Pentagon Strategy, Phase 1, Legislature of the 7th Legislature under the wise leadership of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, and the win-win policy under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, former Director The Minister and current President of the Senate for the fifth term has made the whole society develop rapidly in all fields.
The senior official of the Ministry of Rural Development said that the Royal Government has set out the first phase of the Pentagon strategy, focusing on five priority areas: "human roads, waterways, electricity and technology" to continue to build the foundation to achieve the vision of Cambodia. 2030 is a high middle income country, 2050 is a high income country.
Mr. Yim Chung stated that the implementation of the old policy and the new policy of the Royal Government of the 7th legislature is to be vigilant in maintaining the existing achievements that come from the sacrifices of all civil servants, including Retired officials, we will continue to strive to contribute to the development of the country to maintain peace, social stability, as well as opportunities for national development.
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Thursday, April 4, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, will preside over the closing ceremony of the General Assembly. Work in 2023 and set work direction for 2024.
The Ministry of Public Works was established in 2013 by a combination of three institutions: the Secretariat of Public Function, the General Secretariat of the Council for Administrative Reform, and the Royal School of Administration. The Ministry of Public Function has the mission and duties to lead, manage and develop the public service sector and public administration reform.
In the 7th legislature of the National Assembly, the Ministry of Civil Service has a new task: the Secretariat of the National Committee for Promoting the Implementation of Key Measures for Public Administration Reform of the Royal Government (CWR). The National Committee is chaired by Samdech Mani Hun Manet and is composed of ministers from all ministries, institutions and governors of the 25 provincial governors.
Public administration management, strengthening good governance is one of the priorities and necessities of Samdech Manet for this new term. The Ministry of Civil Service, with Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many as Minister, is a key staff member of the Royal Government in implementing this necessary plan.
Under the Prime Minister's strong leadership vision for the public service sector reform framework, Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many has taken a strong stance with vision and strategy to strive to achieve the vision as well as the vision of the President's leadership.
Starting from the mission and duties, with the support of the previous government, and especially the government of the seventh legislature of the National Assembly under the leadership with a long-term vision and energy of the President in 2023 and early 2024. So far, the Ministry of Public Works has proudly achieved many important achievements.
The Ministry of Public Works has worked and achieved a series of results within the framework of the implementation of key measures to reform public administration related to the following key tasks:
+ Improving the recruitment of public administration officials
The Ministry of Public Function directed and coordinated the preparation of the sub-decree on the implementation of the standard operating procedures for the civil service recruitment competition, as well as led and organized the civil service recruitment competition with merit, transparency, fairness, environment and efficiency in accordance with the statement. The exaltation of Samdech Manipheap Hun Manet is "proudly stuck with despair".
+ Strengthening the capacity and institutional capacity to improve the quality of work
The Technical Working Group of the Ministry of Public Works has prepared draft documents, concepts and guidelines on the review and analysis of the functions and structure of ministries and institutions, and the preparation of updates on the structure and data of civil servants of ministries, institutions and educational institutions and units. Local health and drafted professional ethics
The Ministry has also developed a number of training programs to strengthen the capacity and leadership of leadership units and senior officials of ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations. This training program is implemented by the Royal School of Administration.
Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many expressed his pride in the progress of the civil service sector, which has been contributing to the promotion of governance in public administration, which is a necessary basis for accelerating the socio-economic development of Cambodia.
The Deputy Prime Minister highlighted that these achievements can be achieved due to three main factors: 1: The right policy and strategy of the Royal Government, especially the first phase of the Pentagon strategy for job growth, equity, efficiency and sustainable infrastructure. Foundations towards achieving the vision of 2050 Cambodia to become a high-income country
2: Internal factors of the Ministry of Public Function is because we have a clear vision, will and plan, have the right work structure, have a good work system and especially have leaders and officials at all levels who have high skills, competencies and work on the basis of the approach. Proactive and active, understanding, tolerant, cooperative, team spirit and highly responsible according to their respective skills and duties
3. The participation of ministries, sub-national administrative institutions and all stakeholders with the Ministry of Public Function is a necessary and indispensable condition that ensures the achievement of many achievements in the past and to be achieved in the future. In the future.
