Authorities and police inspect Borei Keila administration, arresting 21 drug users
(Phnom Penh): On April 3, 2024, the forces of Khan 7 Makara Unity Command led by Mr. Theng Sothol, District Governor, inspected the administration in Borei Keila area and arrested 21 suspects related to drugs.
Lieutenant Colonel Chun Bunnan, District Police Inspector of 7 Makara, who led the police force to inspect the work, confirmed that the 21 suspects include: 18 drug users, 3 drug traffickers and confiscated drug exhibits. 19 small packs of drugs.
The 21 suspects were questioned by the authorities for further action.
Kampot Provincial Governor will allow tourists to visit the beach location between the old bridge to the new bridge on the occasion of the upcoming Khmer New Year
(Kampot): Dr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Kampot Province, confirmed that although the construction of the beach between the Rainbow Bridge (Old Bridge) to Kampong Bay Bridge (New Bridge) in Kampot is not yet complete, but the provincial administration Kampot will be open to tourists on the occasion of the upcoming Khmer New Year, while the Department has been busy accelerating the construction of the road to be completed before the Khmer New Year.
This statement was made while the Governor of Kampot Province, Mao Thunin, led government officials, authorities and stakeholders to inspect the progress of the construction of the recreational beach road along the mouth of Kampong Bay canal from the Rainbow Bridge (Old Bridge) to Kampong Bay Bridge (Bridge). New) and a statue of a sea horse in front of the old provincial hall in Kampot on April 3, 2024.
In inspecting this progress, the provincial governor also said that this beach is the heart of Kampot province, after the construction is completed, it will be beautiful and can attract many national and international tourists to visit because this location can Make it possible for tourists to take a bath.
The provincial governor also urged the relevant units, institutions and departments to pay attention to speed up the construction of the above roads before the New Year, to clean up the environment. Special lighting must be studied to install colorful lights to decorate at night to be attractive from the base of the bridge, the rainbow bridge to the new stone bridge.
On the other hand, the 8-meter-tall water horse statue is ready before the traditional Khmer New Year, with colorful lights and water spraying. This is the confirmation of the provincial governor.
At the same time, the provincial governor also said that under the leadership of Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech inspired all capitals and provinces to organize Sankrant events to revive, especially Samdech has laid down mechanisms and principles. Many to promote tourism.
He also urged the authorities in the capitals and provinces to improve the aesthetics, create special entertainment venues, develop and improve in various tourist areas in their geographical areas to attract more national and international tourists to visit.
