The King issued a Royal Decree to promote 30 senior officials of the National Election Committee.
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, has issued a Royal Decree ordering the annual promotion and promotion of senior officials of the National Election Committee of the National Election Committee to you. 30 NEC officials from April 13, 2024. This is according to the Royal Decree obtained by Fresh News on April 3, 2024.
This memorial of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made on April 3, 2024, on the occasion of Samdech's speech after Samdech received the support of 62 out of 62 senators to chair the Senate in The first session of the Senate of the 5th legislature.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also recalled the establishment of the Senate, which was a great blessing of His Majesty the King, who resolved the Cambodian political crisis after the election stage, although the election at that time was nicknamed "a miracle along the river." "Mekong" However, the dissatisfaction of some political parties created a serious crisis after the election.
At this point, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that although the plan to assassinate Samdech in Siem Reap had not been achieved, some of Samdech's generals demanded an attack on Siem Reap. Four rockets exploded, one of which was a tragic event, but despite the assassination of Samdech, Cambodia was still able to convene a parliamentary session and continue to swear in front of Angkor Wat.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that after the National Assembly meeting, the Royal Government of Cambodia has not been formed yet, because at that time, the members of the National Assembly who had already taken the oath were privileged after the bombing of Samdech's house in Phnom Penh by a group of assassins. A small number of demonstrators camped in front of the National Assembly, while Samdech issued an order forbidding all people from leaving Phnom Penh and going abroad.
Samdech said that after the meeting, the deputies left the country, so the political stalemate in Cambodia continued during the political stalemate, but then the idea of establishing the Senate came from Samdech's idea. Vibol Panha Sok An, whom Prak Sokhon also knew about.
Minister of Health gives a lecture on "Management of staff performance" to subordinates
(Phnom Penh): Prof. Chheang Ra, Minister of Health, on April 2, 2024, continued to lead the training course on "Leadership and Innovation" for civil servants under the Ministry of Health through a video conference system with the participation of a total of 2397 people.
This lecture is to strengthen the institution, which is one of the three priority strategies set by the Ministry of Health in support of the implementation of the Royal Government's Pentagon Strategy for the 7th legislature of the National Assembly. And this week, the study focuses on managing staff performance and also presents the use of PDIA by Udong Referral Hospital.
At the same time, the Minister explained the key words in the performance of employees, including the performance of each employee, the stability of the ability to perform the work and the attitude of each employee. For this session, there will also be a presentation on the positive changes in hand hygiene in obstetrics using PDIA of Udong Referral Hospital, Kampong Speu Province.
Please note that this training is held every Tuesday in the presence of national unit leaders from the head of the central office to the Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health and sub-national units from the director of the health center to the director of the Capital Health Department. - Province.
