For the arrest of suspects and the seizure of the above exhibits is a proper application of the forest law. While the relevant experts were inspecting the relevant documents along with the exhibits, the suspect, Ngo Young Lung, cut off some exhibits from the scene, which the police temporarily detained. At the same time, the relevant competent authorities have researched and implemented the procedures in accordance with the Criminal Code and the Forest Law.
Until April 2, 2024, the court decided to detain the suspect, Ngo Young Lung, a 56-year-old Vietnamese man, and put him in prison, which is a proper procedure.
