2: Working with teachers, strengthening the morale and attitude of teachers to be a role model for students, developing teaching methods, students' learning methods, understanding of language, communication, learning environment, both in and around the school.
3: Learning environment Create a clean school environment, promote hygiene and a green environment, implement additional activities both in and out of class, education, health, study to cultivate good habits, discipline, ethics and behavior.
