(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Tuesday, April 2, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the closing ceremony of a meeting to evaluate the results of education. Youth and Sports for the academic year 2022-2023 and set the direction for the academic year 2023-2024.
At the closing ceremony, the winners of the best principals, good teachers, clean schools and medals were presented to the leaders of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, the opportunity to close the meeting of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports:
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that he really supports the evaluation of the three levels of schools that the Ministry has selected and recognized as the 120 model schools in this initial phase in terms of recognizing the school achievements and the high academic results of the students. Both the joint efforts of the school management, teachers, students and families in the development of the school as a school ranked good public service unit, clean school, good director, etc.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that education must be made for a lifetime, even Samdech must study regularly.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that all parents want their children to get a good education.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that in order to have a better education, the grassroots must be strengthened from the grassroots level.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the establishment of a new generation of schools, model schools ... is not created to compete, it is created to strengthen education and to be a stage.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet announces 50 primary schools to strengthen education by extending the study time by 2 more hours.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that the meeting does not need to be long, it is important to set goals and implement them as a result.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that some jobs do not need help, but must be creative to serve.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet wants teachers to be creative to provide more education to students.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised not to impose obligations on parents to participate in the education promotion program.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the relationship between teachers, parents and students is an important factor in helping to achieve better education.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet recommends strengthening the role of the district education office to strengthen the effectiveness of education.
* Samdech Hun Manet praised and appreciated the achievements mentioned in the brief report of HE Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, which really demonstrated the hard work and cooperation of all education staff leaders. Classes, teachers, parents, communities and local authorities in the development of education to move forward in accordance with their respective roles and responsibilities with a high sense of responsibility.
* President Hun Manet spoke in support of the reform program, measures and priorities set out by the conference based on current achievements and new opportunities, and set clear and realistic reform directions with specific goals.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia will continue to give priority to the recruitment of both qualified teachers and technical contract teachers to meet the needs of teachers and quality.
