Dr. Yong Pov: Samdech Techo Hun Sen to lead the Senate is stronger and more unique in terms of fame, content and results
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Yong Pov, General Secretariat of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, on April 2, 2024, stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Chairman of the Supreme Council of the King and Chairman of the Cambodian People's Party, will lead the nation's top institution. (Senate) is stronger and different in both fame, content and results.
Dr. Yong Pov's statement came after Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced his resignation from the National Assembly to a new position in the Senate in April 2024, while Samdech had previously announced that he would go to the position of President of the Senate.
Dr. Yong Pov said that the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) has already decided that the President of the Senate for the fifth term is Samdech Hun Sen, President of the party that won the election. On Wednesday, April 3, 2024, at 8:00 am, the Senate will open the first session of the 5th legislature under the highest presidency of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
* 1: Strong man (Samdech Hun Sen) to lead the nation's top institution is stronger and different in reputation, content and results. The CPP is increasingly in power in all aspects of politics. This can be seen as a CPP strategy to ensure internal peace, guarantee Cambodia's sovereignty and independence.
* 2: The CPP dignitaries who have been matched with the leadership of the Senate are all veteran diplomats plus strong legs, so hopefully Cambodia will be different in the field of diplomacy as well as foreign policy, both front and back.
* 3: The time has come for Cambodia to pursue a strong, sharp, energetic and truly intelligent foreign policy.
* 4: It can be assessed that the eyes of the West will express concern and low evaluation in the work of building a Western-style democracy.
But Dr. Yong Pov stressed that Cambodia must have a Cambodian approach.
