On this auspicious occasion, my wife and I would like to pray for the blessings of the Preah Ratanatray, all the sacred objects in the world, please help nurture and take care of all the blessings, blessings, glory, good luck to Samdech Pichey Sena and Lok Chumteav, as well as sons, daughters, grandsons and grandchildren. May you have the four precious blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength, do not be greedy. ”
