(Kratie): The Thai Embassy in Cambodia, led by Mr. Chhet Kiet, Thai Ambassador to Cambodia, together with more than 20 Thai Embassy and private sector officials in Cambodia visited on April 1, 2024 Kratie province to study and understand business opportunities, investment and the connection of new economic zones between Thailand and Cambodia.
The visit is committed to further enhancing each other's economic interests, especially by increasing the volume of trade and investment, and boosting industrial support between the two countries. Supply, integrate and expand connectivity opportunities to countries in the region.
In addition, there are potential investment opportunities in Kratie province in the agricultural and agro-industrial sectors, with a number of rubber processing and industrial plants currently set up in the SEZ.
All of the above activities are part of the progressive economic and diplomatic mission of the Thai Embassy in Cambodia, which is organized annually to explore economic, trade, investment and connectivity opportunities between Thailand and Cambodia. .
In parallel with the organization of charity programs to contribute to the development of society and community with the cooperation of Thai private companies in Cambodia, this year held in Kratie and Stung Treng between 1-3 April. 2024, with the goal of making the people of both countries grow both economically and socially at the same time.
