On the morning of Thursday, April 2, 2024, the Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, Dr. Sar Sokha, received Lieutenant General Loeung Tam Kwong, Deputy Minister of Police of Vietnam, to lead a delegation to pay a courtesy call at the Ministry of Interior. During his visit to Cambodia for two days from April 1-2, 2024.
