The following is the press release: The Ministry of Economy raises the capacity and awareness of the officers of the specialized units to prepare for the preparation of the 2025 budget
(Preah Sihanouk): The Ministry of Economy and Finance on April 1, 2024 at Sokha Beach Hotel, Preah Sihanouk Province organized "Preparatory Workshop for Budget 2025".
The ceremony was presided over by Dr. Hean Sahip, Secretary of State and Chairman of the Budget Working Group, Budget Unit of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, Representative of Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance. Secretary-General of the General Secretariat of the Ministry, leaders and technical officers of the budget unit, a total of about 250 people.
This workshop was organized under the coordination of the General Secretariat of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the unit in charge of the Ministry of Finance, in order to increase the capacity and awareness of the budget unit of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, focusing on the organization. Budget as well as promote the quality of the Ministry's budget and timely preparation to the General Department of Budget.
He also emphasized that the experience of overseeing the implementation of the 2023 budget in early 2024 shows that the quality of budget preparation is still subject to further strengthening if the Ministry of Economy and Finance intends to continue. Build a role model in implementing achievement budgets.
In this regard, he encouraged all budget units and the General Secretariat of the Ministry to continue to pay attention and consider together in the workshop that will take place over the next two days to continue to be implemented in the budget preparation phase. This 2025.
Dr. Hean Sahip recommends the following tips:
First, the budget unit must pay attention to setting the main work direction of the unit concerned for the medium term, especially for the budget plan for 2025 to have a clear basis in determining the need for resources to support the implementation. Functions and duties of the unit as the technical staff of the Ministry. This work requires the direct involvement of the head of the unit.
Second, the budget unit must determine the priority level of activities to be implemented in 2025 as well as the next budget year by considering the planned expenditures or the items that are no longer needed, in terms of using the budget effectively. And be ready to deduct the budget in case the budget request of the relevant unit is not fully received as requested.
Third, the budget unit must prepare an appropriate and complete explanation as a basis for the General Secretariat of the Ministry to provide support at all stages of budget preparation, especially during budget negotiations.
Fourth, the budget unit and the General Secretariat of the Ministry must continue to work closely to understand the core work of the relevant units in order to improve the quality of providing support on the preparation of indicators and goals, linking the budget to work priorities and guarantees. The effectiveness of the budget of the Ministry as a whole.
Dr. Hean Sahip is optimistic that the two-day workshop will be an important forum for strengthening the capacity of the participants, who are the leaders and technical officers of the budget unit of the Ministry of Budget. More effective, consistent and accountable to achieve the main objectives of the program set by the Ministry.
