(Preah Sihanouk): Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, said that under the right leadership of the energetic, energetic, wise, meticulous and skillful Prime Minister of Cambodia Hun Sen, Samdech always pays attention to give freedom to Widespread religious beliefs to the general population, based on the strengthening of religious harmony of all religious denominations against all acts of discrimination aimed at preventing the commercial exploitation of religion in Cambodia.
