Ramadan has great meaning for Muslims. Ramadan is a month in which Allah, the Almighty, commands Muslims to double their devotion to worship, fasting, and personal donations to help those in need.
He said that Maradan is a month of peace, a month of peace, both mentally and emotionally, a month of goodness, doing good to the common people, especially the weak, the needy, the month of tolerance, the month of mercy, it is The month of charity and almsgiving is a month of celebration as Muslims who practice patience, we do what Allah ought to do, especially the month when the Holy Qur'an is recited for Muslims.
