Ministry of Water Resources announces weather conditions in Cambodia for April 1, 2024
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a notification on the weather situation in Cambodia for April 1, 2024.
The Ministry states that low pressure will cover the Kingdom of Cambodia, Thailand, the Gulf of Thailand, Laos, Vietnam and the South China Sea. Lowland area: * Minimum temperature 26 ° C and maximum temperature 37 ° C. Winds from the southeast and southwest have an average speed of 2 m / s. The northwest will receive rain with thundershowers and gusts covering up to 10% of the area.
The Israeli military says a senior Islamic jihadist militant has been killed in an attack on an Al-Aqsa hospital command center in central Gaza.
"The command center and the terrorists were targeted with specific attacks aimed at reducing the danger to civilians," the military said. "The Al-Aqsa hospital building was not damaged and its operation was not affected."
However, there was no immediate comment from Islamic jihadists, allies of Hamas. But Palestinian health officials and Hamas media said Israel had attacked camps inside the Al-Aqsa hospital compound, killing four people and wounding several others, including five journalists. .
So far, the death toll from Palestinians has risen to 32,782 in the Israeli military offensive in Gaza since October 7, according to the Palestinian Health Authority. The war erupted after Hamas militants violated the border and attacked the southern Israeli community, killing 1,200 people and taking 253 hostages.
The two sides have stepped up negotiations mediated by Qatar and Egypt on a six-week moratorium on Israeli aggression in exchange for the release of 40 of the 130 hostages still being held in the country. Gaza still.
Hamas has sought an agreement to end the fighting and withdrawal of Israeli troops. But Israel has denied the allegations, saying it will continue efforts to dismantle Hamas' control and military capabilities.
