In addition, the Minister urged the local authorities and the factory administration and the staff delegation to work more closely together, because the local authorities, who are the children and servants of the people, are always waiting to provide caring services. Factory and all staff delegates.
After speaking and presenting the composition of local authorities to the factory administration and all staff delegates, the Minister and the district governor had a face-to-face meeting with the factory administration staff and staff representatives of each factory to listen to the needs and establish as well as increase intimacy with More.
