But so far, the company is still operating illegally, and when the authorities came to inspect the location of the above activities, in fact, both workers and company owners escaped without cooperating with the authorities and No authority.
Sources from the local people revealed that since the company installed the wood crushing machine, it is seen that many local bulldozers are transporting fresh and small saplings on the scales every day. Sold to the company, the company claims that it is ground and then transported to make fertilizer, which is the most dangerous case for the forest, which is a natural resource and will be destroyed one day.
