Key Remarks by Samdech Mani Hun Manet on the Occasion of Inauguration of the Stupa and Achievements at Wat Mony Ratanaream in Pursat City
(Pursat): On the morning of Sunday, March 31, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the inauguration ceremony of the stupa and other achievements in Phnom Penh. Wat Mony Ratanaream is located in Sangkat Roleap, Pursat City, Pursat Province.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet:
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet expressed his great pleasure to attend the inauguration of the stupa and achievements in Wat Mony Ratanaream.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that today's program is the inauguration of the first religious achievement for the new government.
* Samdech Thipdey Hun Manet thanked the people of Pursat for supporting the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party. In the 2023 election, about 87 percent of Pursat people went to the polls and more than 90 percent voted for the CPP.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that in response to this trust, the Royal Government will make every effort to serve the people with all its strength.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet considered that the Buddhist structure in Wat Mony Ratanaream will be a Buddhist structure for hundreds of years to come.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet thanked all the benefactors who have worked together to make this achievement a reality.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet expressed his gratitude to the monks, the pagoda committee and the authorities for their joint efforts to lead the construction of achievements in Wat Mony Ratanaream.
* Samdech Techo Hun Manet thanked the Ministry of Water Resources and Pursat Provincial Authority for their efforts to intervene to solve the drought for farmers.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that helping the people is a task that must be done and serve the people.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet praised the workmanship of the construction as well as the paintings to the beautiful and luxurious stupa.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that peace is an important element for nation building. More words of peace than no. So peace is priceless for Cambodia.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that religious freedom was highly valued by the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party after the liberation of the country from the Khmer Rouge regime in 1979.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the achievements in the monasteries are flourishing because the people have the ability to have a better life.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that without a shared culture, it is not possible to build a common achievement.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the culture of sharing in Cambodian society is wide.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet recalled the words of a researcher that the country emerged from the war of shared culture is not very common, but in Cambodia, there is a wide shared culture.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the culture of sharing and the culture of helping each other must continue to be maintained.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that a developed country cannot be happy without clear morals and virtues.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that no matter how developed the country is, it cannot give up its religious role.
* President Hun Manet stated that religion and culture are inextricably linked. In that religion, religious influence has contributed to the preservation of culture.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the protection of cultural property is a big issue for the Royal Government for many terms. Cambodia should not miss the New Year.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia still has the right to use the word "Sankrant" even though Thailand inscribed it on the World Heritage List. This year, the New Year celebration is more fun in the provinces.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government is ready to inscribe 7 more monetary heritage.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that Samdech has instructed the Ministry to prepare documents to apply for "Sankranti" in the Intangible Heritage List next year.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet wants the provincial capitals to compete to organize Sankrant New Year events. Especially if the provincial governor sings again.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet encourages to jointly organize a lot of Khmer folk games in the New Year.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet announces rewards for provinces that do not have traffic accidents on the occasion of the New Year.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advises young people not to play anything that affects the dignity of women during the New Year.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advises to have a high level of patience and understanding when confronting each other while playing during the New Year.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructed the authorities to take care to facilitate the crossing of the border of Cambodian citizens during the New Year and not to charge any fees.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia is not only focused on development, but also on conservation work.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that in order to prevent the encroachment of land as state property, it is necessary to strengthen the strict implementation of the law against violators and wrongdoers. Civil servants of the Armed Forces should not be involved, if relevant, they must terminate their positions.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the municipal / district board of governors has the front line authority to prevent encroachment on state-owned land.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that where there is a hot issue related to the encroachment on state property, the appointment and change of district leaders must be considered with efficiency.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that helping people without land must help, but the protection of land as state property must also be protected.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that 10 cities / districts with strong land encroachment activities will be considered to change the leadership.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised to confiscate about 4 km of land at the eel road in Veal Veng district as a conservation area for tourism.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet decided to Mr. Keo Rattanak as the Chairman of the Working Group to lead the discussion to confiscate this land and save it.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet announces the suspension of the issuance of natural connection investment projects with less than 10 hectares of land.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that for the implementation project and allowed to continue. However, for any project that is not implemented correctly and is seriously wrong, it must be revoked. For projects that have been licensed and have not been implemented for 6 months.
