BEIJING, March 27 (Xinhua) - Fukuda Yasuo, chairman of the Boao Forum for Asia Advisory Committee and former Japanese prime minister, said in an exclusive interview with China Central Radio and Television on March 27 that the economy China has great influence on the world economy, he expects China's economic development efforts to continue to contribute to the driving force of global economic development.
Fukuda Yasuo sees the Boao Forum for Asia as an important forum for dignitaries of many countries to discuss and exchange views on key policy processes and global development issues. In this annual meeting, the topic of discussion that he focuses on is "technology development". He agreed with China's actions to accelerate the training and development of new quality production forces.
