(Phnom Penh): In order to maintain security, safety, order and public order in Phnom Penh, as well as to preserve the national tradition and the beautiful dignity of our nation, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration has announced a ban on all forms of illegal gambling and gambling. Water throwing games, throwing colored or dirty water, throwing water bags, painting with charcoal or powder, and beating with sticks or other tools during Khmer New Year.
According to the announcement of Phnom Penh Capital Administration, which was received by Fresh News on the evening of March 28, 2024, Phnom Penh Capital Administration appealed to the people, especially young people, young men, women, students and workers, such as:
First, obey the road traffic law and do not drive while intoxicated to avoid accidents.
Second: All forms of illegal gambling are strictly prohibited.
Thirdly, it is forbidden to play water throwing games, throwing colored or dirty water, throwing water bags, spraying charcoal or powder, and beating people with vehicles or other devices because it can lead to accidents. Traffic affects lives, injures or damages property, etc.
Fourth, prohibit the import, distribution, purchase and sale of fireworks and all kinds of explosives that can cause surprise, cause insecurity and affect the order and safety of citizens and passengers.
Fifth: Participate in fire prevention with caution and high ownership of candles, incense burners, electric stoves to maintain property, personal life and others.
Sixth: Encourage the people and young men and women to participate in Khmer folk games in large numbers.
