In particular, air transport, with the need for military transport, is open to both national and international levels according to the specific needs of each mission. This is the additional confirmation of Major General Som Yom.
Lt. Gen. Som Yom stated that in order to achieve high safety, security and success in the above flight missions, military pilots must also have the knowledge base, training programs and skills in accordance with the requirements for use in their flight missions. Both nationally and internationally.
In addition, Major General Som Yom said that this training course is one of the best ways to provide opportunities for all trainees to learn and learn more about this important knowledge and skills to be used in their careers. A pilot, even if they are in the military.
