The Royal Government sets the level of salary and taxable income, salary of 1.5 million Riels down, not taxable monthly, income 18 million Riels down, not taxable annually
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has just issued a sub-decree setting the level of monthly taxable salary and annual taxable income.
According to the sub-decree signed on March 11, 2024, the salary level of 1.5 million riels and below is not taxable monthly and the income of 18 million baht is not taxable annually.
