A famous Chinese food in the area
The vast territory of China has made people in different regions have different eating habits, for example, people in the south like to eat and taste sweet food, while people in the north like to eat food made from Noodles and salty flavors Eastern people like sour taste, while Westerners prefer spicy taste, which creates a diverse eating culture.
Cultural self-confidence drives Chinese people to seek to preserve and develop their culture and traditions through innovation. Especially in the new era where information technology has flourished, food culture such as local specialty foods has been widely promoted on social media and mobile video apps, making these specialty foods "stars." Famous on the Internet.
In fact, "jeepo barbecue" is not new, so why is it so famous all over the country? The first factor is due to the ease of travel. Jeep High Speed Rail Station offers great convenience for commuters to this city, especially those from other provinces and cities to taste the "Jeep BBQ" in just a few hours. .
The second factor is due to the food culture of Shandong Province. Shandong Province is an ancient source of Chinese culture and civilization, especially Confucianism. "Jeep Roast" has a long history and is continued and promoted to the present day, the local people have promoted the special food of their hometown, making the local food culture can survive.
"Famous local food" Promoting local food culture to revitalize it is not only conducive to the food industry, but also to tourism, as in the case of "Jeep BBQ". »And" Spicy Suan Food "all over the country also attracts many tourists, especially young people to go there to taste the original taste of special food, which is popular on social media and travel.
Preservation and innovation It is not the opposite of a beautiful tradition, we must preserve it, and in the process of conservation should include new innovations so that the tradition has a new life force and a new face that is more visible. Self-confidence in the culture of a nation, as well as the preservation and development of culture, civilization and traditional traditions to be stable, stable and truly glorious.
