Cambodia-China Friendship Radio Comment: Cambodia considers Boao forum to play an important role for the international community
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Chairman of the Supreme Council of the King of Cambodia, leads a high-level delegation to attend the annual meeting of the Boao Forum from March 27-29, 2024 in Hainan Province, People's Republic of China. At the invitation of the Chinese side, according to a press release from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.
Samdech Techo will deliver a speech at the opening ceremony of the conference on "Asia and the World: Challenges and Common Responsibilities." The forum will bring together government leaders, businesses, academia, international organizations and regional organizations to discuss key issues facing and promote international cooperation. Samdech Techo will also meet with senior Chinese officials.
"Samdech Techo's mission, of course, has contributed to the sharing of experiences of peaceful leadership and development in Cambodia, as well as enhancing the traditional relations between Cambodia and China, as well as win-win multilateral cooperation." .
Dr. Kao Muy Thong, an analyst, said that after the global epidemic, the world is facing a more complex geopolitical situation, such as the Russia-Ukraine conflict, Israel-Hamas, high inflation, and climate change. Affect the world. Therefore, he believes that this annual conference will continue its efforts for the world.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen will also pay a visit to the Chinese Academy of Tropical Agricultural Sciences, Wenchang International Space City to promote Cambodia-China cooperation on agricultural and technological development.
