At the same time, the Minister suggested that the National Children's Hospital should increase the number of beds in proportion to the continuous growth of patients, in line with the infrastructure of the building, especially to be ready to solve various health problems. Possible for mothers, babies and children.
At the same time, the Minister also gave some ideas to the members of the whole meeting to take into consideration in preparing the plan and direction for work in 2024, including:
