The Deputy Prime Minister said that the drug issue must be cut off together to fight because drugs not only destroy security, but also destroy human resources in Cambodia. He understood that if not changed, many years later, the society will be destroyed.
Deputy Prime Minister Keut Rith stated: "The most interesting thing is the fourth key measure and the fifth key measure on drugs, which is why I announced publicly at the press conference that the justice sector must be isolated. On drug issues. "In other institutions, it is up to other institutions to implement the fourth key measure of His Majesty the King, but our justice sector must adhere to this principle."
"I want to confirm again and again that I have announced and I can not withdraw this statement if it is found to be of interest to the drug lord. I apologize, I have no choice but to submit information and this case. To the Anti-Corruption Unit.
