Cambodia is gradually gaining attention and booking from Indian tourists after preparing to launch direct flights in the middle of this year!
Chhay Sivlin, President of the Cambodian Tourism Association, told Fresh News that India is the world's second largest tourism market after China, so opening direct flights between Cambodia and India is a good sign to attract people. India travels to Cambodia.
He also said that after the plan to launch direct flights between Cambodia and India was announced, the Cambodian Tourism Association signed a number of agreements and received many inquiries about Indian visitors to Cambodia. Regarding prices and services as well as tourism products. Also, book a tour package.
She added that recently, Cambodia has also gradually received a large number of Indian tourists, who came to visit the mainland from neighboring countries.
According to the president of the Cambodian Tourism Association, most Indian tourists prefer cultural and heritage sites, historical sites, beaches and casinos.
She said that in the past, the influx of Indian tourists to Cambodia has been small, which is a major obstacle due to the lack of direct flights.
She said that while 2024 is the year to celebrate the "First Cambodia-India Tourism Year 2024", she wants the participation of all stakeholders to provide hospitality to Indian tourists. Contribute to attracting more Indian visitors.
Thuon Sinan, Asia-Pacific Tourism Association, said India is a densely populated and well-traveled country. Therefore, India is a very important market for Cambodia.
(Kampong Cham): On the morning of March 27, 2024, Mr. Dr. Neth Savoeun, Deputy Prime Minister and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Kampong Cham Province, represented by His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia at the inauguration ceremony. Assembly Hall and pass on achievements in Wat Cam One (called Wat Boeung Snay) located in Boeung Bassac Village, Sangkat Sambo Meas, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province.
Speaking on the occasion, Deputy Prime Minister Neth Savoeun said that the Buddhist pagoda is very important in contributing to nation building and is also an important training center for the society.
The Deputy Prime Minister emphasized that, in fact, in the area of Wat Cam One, Boeung Snay, there are schools like in other pagodas, especially at the primary school level, which is the original breeding training road in line with the direction of the Royal Government of the 7th mandate. That is, training needs to be strengthened from primary school onwards.
Therefore, the role of all monks and nuns is to help further the management and counseling of the primary school in this monastery to work well, in collaboration with the Department of Education as well as the principal to improve the quality of education of children and grandchildren. Students for a knowledge base for the future.
The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, said that in 2015, Preah Dhammasal Vongsavirak, Preah Vinay Thor, Provincial Councilor and Chief Prelate of Wat Cam One, Boeung Snay, initiated the construction of a new sub-school with a size of 45 meters by 28 meters. The old state is dilapidated and to provide a large space for Buddhists who are generous to perform rituals in accordance with the Buddhist path.
The provincial governor said that the construction site of the new school was opened by Samdech Preah Vanroth Kittibandit Noy Chrek, Samdech Sangkha, the second deputy director and Mr. Kao Sok An, the deputy governor on May 21, 2015.
As a result of the construction of this school sub-district, due to the great solidarity of the Buddhist leaders and philanthropists, especially on behalf of the Kampong Cham Provincial Administration and the Chairman of the Provincial Council, the Solidarity Kathen Festival was organized on November 6, 2021 with 79 suffixes. , $ 800 to help complete the construction of this school annex.
In addition, Buddhists near and far at the foot of the pagoda who have fully supported the construction of achievements in this temple with a total budget of 1,169,501 dollars.
