The US State Department says a US-South Korean team is considering actions that could disrupt North Korea's oil procurement network, including exposing sanctions, unilateral sanctions on the private sector or Any third party involved in the facilitation of oil transportation, both intentionally and unintentionally.
Under UN Security Council sanctions on North Korea's nuclear weapons and missile programs, Pyongyang is set to import 4 million barrels of crude oil and 500,000 barrels of refined products a year.
UN experts monitoring the implementation of the sanctions said in March that North Korean-flagged tankers may have imported more than 1.5 million barrels of refined oil products between January 1. Until September 15, 2023. Pictures from commercial satellites show North Korean oil tankers, some of which are under sanctions, docked in a Russian port in recent weeks.
(Phnom Penh): In 2024, 34 Cambodian students have successfully passed the Japanese Government Scholarship Exam, as these students will soon be going to study at universities in Japan. For scholarships that Cambodian students receive from the Royal Government of Japan in 2024, there are three levels, including: postgraduate level, technical secondary level and vocational training level.
Ms. Nan Srey Nich said, "Before receiving the scholarship, I collected the documents of the retake exam, which took more than two months as a result of this effort until success."
After receiving a scholarship from the Government of Japan in 2024 and being ready to study in Japan for 4 years, Ms. Srey Nich expressed her commitment to study hard, especially to take the knowledge trained in Japan to share. Share that knowledge to Cambodian youth and participate in national development with the Royal Government.
Meanwhile, Krouch Thavorak, a student from Kampong Chhnang province, said that before deciding to take the scholarship exam to study in Japan, he personally studied and sought out other students who applied for the scholarship.
"In addition, before applying for the Royal Government Scholarship Exam, I prepared the documents from the website of the Embassy of Japan and other documents related to the exam that the senior students shared," said Krouch Thavarak.
Kroch Thavorak continued that the scholarship of the Royal Government of Japan is very important so that young Cambodians like himself can achieve the desire to study in Japan as dreamed. Cambodian youth should try to apply for scholarships announced by the Japanese government to Cambodian students.
It should be noted that the Japanese government has been providing scholarships for Cambodian students to continue their studies in Japan since 1992. So far, more than 1,400 young Cambodians have received scholarships to study in Japan. Many Cambodian alumni studying in Japan are playing an active role in various fields.
There is still aggressive advertising of online games despite the efforts of the authorities to prevent
(Phnom Penh): Despite the Cambodian Gambling Management Commission's efforts to prevent and guide, it is observed that there is still an aggressive promotion of online gambling on Facebook.
Mr. Ros Phirun, Secretary General of the Cambodian Gambling Management Commission, told Fresh News on March 27, 2027 that since February 14, 2024, after the order of Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Secretary General of the Gambling Management Commission of Cambodia. Karma Cambodia has been cracking down on illegal gambling games spread on social media.
At the same time, the Commission for the Management of Commercial Gambling in Cambodia also cooperated with the General Commission of the National Police to summon celebrities who participated in promoting illegal online gambling to introduce and sign contracts to stop participating in promoting illegal gambling and requested the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications to Blocked 112 online gambling websites.
According to Mr. Ros Phirun, the Cambodian Gambling Management Committee has also organized five meetings on gambling management and gambling impact management with sub-national authorities in Battambang, Takeo, Kampong Cham, Kandal and provinces. Kampong Speu will continue to organize this discussion meeting in other provinces.
Please be informed that the order of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet to inspect the gambling place all over the country after the comedian Neay Kreung sang and produced a music video to promote the public to play online games. Due to strong reactions from experts and the public, the director released a video apologizing publicly and decided to delete the song from the online game from social media on the evening of February 12, 2024.
