Officials of the National Bank of Cambodia: Replacing old riel banknotes with new ones is free of charge and can be exchanged at all branches of banking and microfinance institutions.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhim Chankosal, Deputy Treasurer of the National Bank of Cambodia, said that there is no fee deduction for exchanging old banknotes for new ones, except for the National Bank of Cambodia. Exchange Riel banknotes at all branches of commercial banks and microfinance institutions throughout Cambodia.
