Mr. Lim Chankosal said, "There is no fee for exchanging old riel banknotes for new riel banknotes. The National Bank of Cambodia has requested all banking and microfinance institutions to help. "Exchange old riel banknotes to make it easier for people, especially people living in remote areas to exchange new riel banknotes just by going to a commercial bank branch or any institution."
Please be informed that the National Bank of Cambodia has cooperated with the banking and financial institutions to accept deposits in the provinces and cities to organize the "Love Riel" campaign, which will include the exchange of old riel banknotes, torn and replaced with new banknotes. All types to the public from March 20 to 29, 2024.
