Col. Sok Leng said that in the victim's complaint, it was stated that at 14:50 on March 21, 2024, at Teuk Thla village, Sangkat Teuk Thla, Serey Sophorn city, two suspects used tricks. Entered to order several cases of beer from the victim, and the victim put the beer on the car and then the suspect drove away.
Brigadier General Sok Leng stated that after arresting and interrogating the two suspects, they confessed that they had taken the beer without paying, and on March 7, 2024, they Tricked to buy 8 cases of villagers' beer and escaped in a car.
The two suspects were tested positive for drugs. Based on the confession and the actual evidence, the Serei Sophorn Municipal Gendarmerie has prepared a case file and sent it to the Provincial Gendarmerie Command to proceed with the procedure.
The two suspects have now been sent to the Provincial Court by the Provincial Gendarmerie Criminal Office on Sunday afternoon, March 24, 2024 to follow the procedure. Throughout Battambang province, pay attention to work related to the election, including security
(Battambang): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Battambang Provincial Party Working Group, chaired a meeting on the afternoon of March 24, 2024 to summarize the election results. Senators of the 5th legislature in 2024 in Battambang province, 4th constituency and proposed to implement the joint plan towards the election of the 4th mandate provincial councils at the Sangke Theater, Battambang Municipality, Battambang Province.
On behalf of the Battambang Provincial Party Working Group, Samdech Krala Hom agreed and supported the report summarizing the results of the 5th Senate election, which reflected the activities and experiences gained by the working group and the provincial party in the election process. This important message.
According to the official election results announced by the National Election Committee, the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) received a total of 10,052 votes in all constituencies in the eight regions, a total of 11,699 votes. 85.9%, winning 55 seats in the Senate out of a total of 58 seats to be elected in the eight constituencies.
In Battambang province, the CPP received 706 votes, 22 more than the CPP's turnout, resulting in the CPP winning nine Senate seats in the fourth constituency. Exceeded the number of seats determined by the Standing Committee of the Central Committee by 1 seat.
Samdech continued that the great success of the party in the election of senators for the 5th term has created strong conditions for our party to continue to manage the Senate, which is the most important institution of the nation.
Samdech stated that the Cambodian People's Party has been successful in the process of free, multi-party democratic elections, both general and non-general elections, as well as 19 national and sub-national elections.
Samdech underlined that on May 26, 2024, our country will organize non-general elections to elect the Capital, Provincial, Municipal, District and Khan Councils of the fourth mandate to continue to promote the process of democratic governance reform and decentralization at the level of Under the nation, which is a reform policy initiated by the Cambodian People's Party to continue to move forward to participate in the long-term sustainable development of the country.
At the same time, the election of the Capital, Provincial, Municipal, District and Khan Councils is a guarantee to promote the process of sub-national administrative reform in accordance with the policy of decentralization and deconcentration, which is the policy and reform program initiated by the Cambodian People's Party to continue to move forward. Sustainable to contribute to the promotion of public services and local development to meet the needs of every citizen in society.
On this basis, on behalf of the Cambodian People's Party, Samdech appealed to all commune councilors to go to the polls and vote for the CPP so that the party can continue to lead the provincial councils and councils. Districts and districts throughout Prey Veng province.
