On this occasion, Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many urged and encouraged young On Phanit to continue their efforts to learn better to use this knowledge to serve the motherland and family to become a pillar of the nation. Khmer civilization experts describe the factors of national unity
(Phnom Penh): Khmer civilization expert, Mr. Rath Sandab, described that in the human society in the world, whether it is a foreign nation or our Khmer nation, if there is unity as one great family, it will provide success that makes the society The nation is prosperous and progressive in all areas and in all fields.
Therefore, when it comes to the word unity, since the fall of the Angkorian Empire, we have always heard politicians, monks, and people from all walks of life shout for the Cambodian people to be united as one great Khmer family. Khmer will be as strong as during the Angkorian Empire again, but does not seem to have explained what factors must be taken in order for the nation to be united.
In this sense, in order to unite the nation must start from six factors:
* 1: Starting from the beginning is mutual understanding * 2: When we know each other, it leads to love and trust * 3: When there is love and trust, it leads to love and happiness * 4: When Who knows the happiness and suffering of each other, leads to know how to save each other * 5: When you know how to save each other, leads to sharing and finally * 6: This sharing leads to national unity This alone.
Mr. Rath Sandab continued that national unity in this sense refers to any unity that brings about decision-making, reconciliation, unity or unity of strength, body, mind, wisdom and spirit, leading to progress, progress and success in peace. A strong force to fight against the enemy, all obstacles, all situations, which is like a stick of unity, a force that no enemy dares to persecute.
Solidarity is an important and strong driving force in fulfilling the task and solving all problems, big or small, which is the bond of cooperation that occurs between two or more people as a family, as a group, as a community, society and people. The whole nation. Bring love, intimacy, trust, respect for rights, sharing, understanding, tolerance, respect for each other as human beings.
In conclusion, Mr. Rath Sandab stated that in the social reality, the force of unity creates happiness in order to keep the family line with dignity. Because unity is a determinant for us to know and know how to get along with each other, know how to help each other and live together, create a brotherhood that is even closer and stronger.
In the life of living full of dignity, honor, happiness, morality, virtue, ethics, leading to development in all circumstances. For example, the story of Rey and the ants reflects the unity of the ant group, always providing a model that benefits people to be united and lead to success in all tasks, big or small.
The assailant who killed his wife in Samaki Meanchey district and his accomplices were cracked down by the police
(Kampong Chhnang): Two suspects, one a murderer and the other an accomplice, were arrested by the Samaki Meanchey District Police in cooperation with the Provincial Police and sent to the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police after killing a woman and taking her to the polls. Discard in the middle of the night. The above incident happened on the night of March 22, 2024 in Roleang village, Tbeng Khpos commune, Samaki Meanchey district, Kampong Chhnang province.
Colonel Seng Chanda, Samaki Meanchey District Police Inspector, told Fresh News that at 7:20 pm on March 22, 2024, residents found the body of a dead woman at the mouth of the Boeung Roleang sewer in the village. The commune reported the incident to the local administrative police after the police inspected the scene in cooperation with the specialized force of the provincial police.
On the morning of March 23, the Samaki Meanchey District Inspectorate continued to cooperate with the specialized forces of the Provincial Police to conduct a thorough search until the perpetrators and accomplices were identified, bringing the two suspects During the interrogation, the man confessed in front of the police that he had actually killed his wife and taken her to the above point to divert the traces.
In front of the police, the suspect's husband admitted that before the incident, he and another friend had been drinking with two people in the victim's house (wife) while drinking with her husband's friend. He took his wife's phone to play with, while the wife demanded the phone back, not wanting her husband to take his phone to play, causing a verbal conflict that led to his wife's death.
Currently, the suspect, the murderer and another accomplice, were arrested and sent to the provincial police commissioner to build a file to be sent to the provincial court for legal action.
