The team inspected a total of 6 vehicles, including 4 vehicles equipped with NC and TH logos, overweight from 26-37 tons, were fined and detained for one year in accordance with the law. Road, Article 60 and Notification No. 049 Proclamation on the enforcement of more stringent measures for heavy transport vehicles driving on the road network.
In connection with the penalty for overweight transport for the four vehicles, the team inspected the vehicles for technical defects, and also corrected the requirements of the semi-trailers that were technically high.
At the same time, the Ministry of Public Works and Transport would like to request all parties concerned to stop the culture of intervention when stopping overweight vehicles. The Ministry will continue to take strict measures to enforce the above laws and notices without exception.
