This assessment of the President of the National Assembly of Thailand was made this morning, March 22, 2024, on the occasion that he was allowed to pay a courtesy call on Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, Acting Head of State of the Kingdom of Cambodia. On the occasion, he led a delegation to pay an official visit to Cambodia.
On that occasion, Mr. Van Mohammad Namtha noted that the investment between the two countries has been steadily increasing, as well as better relations and cooperation in all fields.
The Thai parliamentary speaker stressed that the two countries 'parliaments have a good friendship and relations and cooperation with each other, and called on the two countries' legislatures to further strengthen ties and cooperation. Common cause of both countries and peoples
The Acting Head of State considered that the visit of the delegation to Cambodia on this occasion really contributed to the maintenance of deepening the traditional friendship, solidarity and cooperation between the people and the two countries. Bring huge benefits to each other, both now and in the future.
The Acting Head of State stressed that the two countries have maintained good relations and upgraded to a "strategic partnership" to serve the mutual benefit of the two peoples. Both countries have a monarchical political system, with a king, a monarchy, cultural traditions, bordering and sharing the same Mekong waters. These similarities make the two people have a deep love for each other.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum emphasized that 2025 is the 75th anniversary of the establishment of Cambodian-Thai diplomatic relations. Samdech congratulated the Prime Ministers of the two countries for agreeing to establish a number of joint programs to celebrate the anniversaries of the two countries. At the same time, Samdech wished the Thai government success in hosting the 33rd SEA Games in 2025.
