(Phnom Penh): Brigadier General Ou Sophal, Deputy Director of the Criminal Police Department of the Ministry of Interior, on March 21, 2024, filed a complaint against four people to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
The people the general is suing include:
* First name: Yoy Nuon, male, chief of Trapeang Prey village, Sangkat Ksem Ksan, Udong Mechey city, Kampong Speu province * Second name: Sok Pov, female, living in Trapeang Prey village, Sangkat Ksem Ksan, Udong Me Chey city, Kampong Speu province * Third name: Sour Srey Keo, female * Fourth: Name: Ouch Sophal, Male, Residence: # 56, Street 608, Sangkat Boeung Kak II, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
Brigadier General Ou Sophal sued the four men for three offenses:
* First: inciting to commit crimes, etc. * Second: Public defamation * Third: Destroying the property of others.
It should be noted that the complaint filed by Brigadier General Ou Sophal to the above prosecutor's representative was made after the village chief complained to Ou Sophal to Deputy Prime Minister Sar Sokha, Minister of Interior, about violence and death threats.
In the complaint, Brigadier General Ou Sophal stated that during 2021, Yoy Nuon brought his nephew Sao Savuth to buy Hua Huot's land. Later, Mr. Yoy Nuon also had a dispute over the commission and the fee for signing the transfer of land with Hua Huot in the amount of $ 300. To help end the dispute between Yoy Nuon and Hour Huot, Brigadier General Ou Sophal gave Yoy Nuon $ 150 at the time.
Recently, Sour Srey Keo and Ouch Sophal filed a complaint and handed over $ 200 to Trapeang Prey village chief Yoy Nuon and Sok Pov in exchange for a thumbprint to sue General Ou Sophal. His Excellency Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior.
Regarding this case, Mr. Chun Sary, Sangkat Chief of Ksem Ksan Commune, stated that the story that Mr. Yoy Nuon, Trapeang Prey Village Chief and Mr. Sok Pov complained to General Ou Sophal to the Ministry of Interior was organized by someone behind the scenes. But fiction.
On the afternoon of March 20, 2024, the Bar Association of Cambodia yesterday sent three lawyers for questioning to defend the rights of Mr. Yoy Nuon and Ms. Sok Pov, but when questioned, both of them Answering the exact opposite of what is in the complaint, that is, what they said in the complaint and giving interviews to journalists in the past, is what those behind it have planned.
The commune chief said that on March 21, 2024, Mr. Yoy Nuon and Ms. Sok Pov traveled to the Ministry of Interior to withdraw their complaint so that there would be no further disputes.
In his complaint on March 5, 2024, Mr. Yoy Nuon stated that in April 2022, at around 10:00 AM, there was a land dispute that escalated into violence, and then he went to mediate. Suddenly, Ou Sophal shouted threats and tore his shirt and threatened to shoot him.
He said that at around 6 pm on the same day, Ou Sophal and his party had been drinking on the disputed land, and Ou Sophal and his party had fired several shots, which shocked the people in the area. Strong, but no one dared to ban.
