(Phnom Penh): Phnom Penh Governor Khuong Sreng said that as of now, there are people living in Phnom Penh who owe more than $ 40 million in garbage bills, these debts increased during the 199 epidemic. Debt owed by landlords to foreigners to run companies and businesses.
Mr. Khuong Sreng made this statement during a press conference after the official inauguration of the five-year river cleaning mission from 2023 to 2028 on the morning of March 20, 2024 at the Hayat Hotel. Regency Sea Phnom Penh.
Mr. Khuong Sreng continued that the garbage collection in Phnom Penh was timely and correct, so as not to clog the garbage, which caused some garbage to be thrown into the canals and some to fall into the river, which caused water pollution and throwing. Harm to humans and animals.
The governor of Phnom Penh said: "Since the garbage collection reform until today, we look at the debt of about $ 40 million that people have not yet paid, but are also considering that in the context of Kovid 19 "Some companies and residents have migrated back to their country and his rented house is no longer rented, but we have done this work closely."
Mr. Khuong Sreng stated that the Phnom Penh Capital Administration has a solid waste management office and a solid waste enterprise to operate on the garbage problem, but the garbage problem is that the Phnom Penh government always loses money due to not having regular payments or not paying at all.
The Governor of Phnom Penh also called on the people living in Phnom Penh who have garbage problem to contact the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, which has a solid waste management office to work on garbage. In addition, he instructed the people to follow the dissemination of information of the solid waste management to the people.
Mr. Khuong Sreng said that in the world, there is no city that produces garbage and does not pay a fee for garbage, and only some cities in some countries have a fee to pay this garbage is more expensive than Phnom Penh. Cambodia also exists.
Mr. Khuong Sreng emphasized that the payment of garbage is the obligation of the people who consume and dispose of garbage, while in the world, no state pays for garbage instead of litter. Therefore, let the people pay the garbage service regularly according to the schedule.
"And there is bankruptcy, the company has to immediately apply to the solid waste management office to write off his debt, we also understand this problem in some cities today, before he rented to foreigners, he was obliged to pay the garbage fee, but "When a foreigner is not born back home, he leaves his house, so we do this work with him very closely, without making it difficult for him." This is an additional statement of Mr. Khuong Sreng.
