(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Wednesday, March 20, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting. Work direction 2024 of the Ministry of Rural Development.
