(Pursat): Authorities in Pursat province's Veal Veng district have issued a press release following a post on social media regarding forest land at the Phnom Samkos wildlife sanctuary, which has been destroyed.
Authorities confirmed that some social media posts alleged that the forest land at Phnom Samkos Wildlife Sanctuary, located at Sre Ampil, Krapeu Pi Krom village, Krapeu Pi commune, Veal Veng district, was at risk.
As for the location of the land outside the hard plan, the environmental official also found that the land is outside the natural resource protection area, not in the conservation area of Phnom Samkos Wildlife Sanctuary, as reported by the media.
According to the authorities, the posting on social media is really confusing to the public and the authorities reject it completely. The National Bank of Cambodia encourages companies to increase their salaries in riel.
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Dr. Chea Serey, Governor of the National Bank of Cambodia, continues to encourage companies and enterprises to increase their salaries in KHR and request that banking and financial institutions provide options for all customers to have access to QR codes. QR code) in riel to facilitate the daily payment in riel.
Dr. Chea Serey's encouragement was made on the occasion of her participation in the 44th Anniversary of the Riel Re-launch of "Riel's Advancement and Bakong System" on March 20, 2024. .
Dr. Chea Serey said that the National Bank of Cambodia has recently partnered with the United Nations Development Program in Cambodia (UNDP Cambodia) to study the promotion of the use of the riel in payment of garments in the garment sector. Clothing, footwear and travel goods.
Research has found that workers earn US dollars, but most of their daily expenses and remittances to their families are in riel, which is more than 80 percent, causing workers to lose time and money due to exchange, according to the survey. Many workers also agreed to pay in full or in part in riel.
Dr. Chea Serey said, "I would like to take this opportunity to encourage companies to increase their salaries in riel, and to banks and financial institutions, deposit-taking microfinance institutions and payment service providers." "All customers have the option to use the QR code in riel to facilitate regular riel payments."
Dr. continued that the use of more riel will help strengthen national sovereignty and build a more sustainable society.
"I would like to call on ministries, institutions, banks and financial institutions, factories, companies, enterprises, business owners, the general public and all stakeholders to continue to contribute more to the use of the riel in their operations, such as through "Paying for labeling of goods and services, providing credit and savings in riel, as well as providing more favorable conditions for the use of riel."
Cambodia, China hold scientific dialogue on Cambodia's views on China's resurgence in global media
(Phnom Penh): A group of Cambodian-Chinese experts organized a scientific dialogue on "Cambodia's views on China's resurgence in the global media."
The dialogue was organized by the Asia-Pacific Regional Headquarters of the Director General of China Central Radio and Television and coordinated by the Royal Academy of Cambodia on the afternoon of March 19, 2024.
Speaking at the opening of the dialogue, Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, said that by ordering China's progress, three points, including:
First, foreign policy, foreign policy has dominated the international arena, showing its strength in the belt and the road, a policy that shows the world that "you initiate and do, not just say and do not do." That no. ”
Second, he personally defined that where there is light, there is the Chinese people, the Chinese people have covered almost everywhere in the world, the world needs peace and prosperity, so the Chinese people are pouring in. More and more Chinese culture, civilization and customs in this wonderful world.
Third, all societies have always received attention about China, especially food, which has grown significantly in the Cambodian market.
Dr. Sok Touch stated that the global publicity of China's resurgence is in line with the view that this decade is the century of Asia. While under the leadership of President Xi Jinping, China has spread its fame on the international stage, especially in Asia as a whole, always supporting Chinese culture deeply rooted in Asia.
Dr. said that the relationship between Cambodia and China has a long history, born of leaders of all generations. The discussions on this occasion are important to reflect the rapid development of Cambodia-China relations and as a contribution to the Royal Government of Cambodia, especially under the high leadership of Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
In particular, Lao Li, deputy director of the Asia-Pacific regional headquarters of China Central Radio and Television, said that 2024 is a "year of people-to-people exchanges between China and Cambodia" and the anniversary. 75 of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
For Dr. Yong Pov, Secretary-General of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, the rise of China due to China's own politics, the challenge of geopolitical influence. China itself means choosing a realistic policy approach in the Chinese way, which makes China constantly evolve in terms of building resilience.
