About 200 meters from the wedding, an unidentified person riding a Dreamsong motorcycle threw two glasses at his son, hitting his left forearm with a bloody wound. .
After that, his son and his friend fled to the national road. When they arrived at Wat Ses Sar in Phsar Snoul village, the suspects threw a sword at their son, causing his grandmother Saing Sophal, who The family was taken to Kratie Provincial Referral Hospital for treatment, but due to the seriousness of the situation, the medical team was sent to Phnom Penh.
After receiving the complaint, the police in cooperation with the police arrived at the scene to search and arrested 4 suspects in a row and 2 escaped.
