National Assembly President Khuon Sodary thanked Samdech Hun Manet for sending a message of condolences on the death of His Excellency Khuon Phallarith, his brother.
(Phnom Penh): The National Assembly President of Cambodia, Khuon Sodary, on March 18, 2024, sent a message of deep gratitude to Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, for sending condolences on the death of His Excellency Khuon Phallarith. Deputy Chief of Cabinet and brother of the National Assembly President Khuon Sodary.
It should be noted that His Excellency Khuon Phallarith, Deputy Director of the Cabinet and a brother of Samdech Moha National Assembly President Khuon Sodary, passed away on Saturday, March 16, 2024 at 5:00 PM. 40 minutes at the age of 67 due to illness.
