(Siem Reap): Mr. Sok Soken, Minister of Tourism, said that in 2024, there will be many big events related to tourism, including major international events. But he has not yet revealed what those events are. However, the minister confirmed that the events will start from April.
At the same time, Mr. Sok Soken, Minister of Tourism, confirmed that Cambodia's tourism destinations in 2024 include China and India, the most populous and most visited countries in the world.
