The governor said that the primary school is an important foundation for primary education, contributing to the achievement of the above results by strengthening the training of children, students as the next generation of bamboo shoots with quality and education in good condition. This is very important to attract children to want to continue their education for a long time.
Dr. Ban Pham sent and instructed the team to grasp the well-being of the people, not just to visit for a while, especially for children in poor families who may be at high risk of abandonment. Drop out of school.
