Speaking to supporters in Ohio, Donald Trump warned, after repeatedly claiming that his defeat in the 2020 election under current US President Joe Biden was due to Fraud of the election process. "If we do not win this election, I do not think we can have another election in this country," Trump said.
Tram, who is facing criminal charges in Georgia for trying to change the 2020 election results there this week, has just won enough votes to become a Republican candidate to run in the election. The president will take office on November 5.
