Samdech Kittipritthbandit also cares about the well-being of the Cambodian people, as he always calls on our people to adhere to healthy living habits and avoid diseases.
Since this year's theme is relevant to all: for a healthy and climate-resilient community, she called on students to join the Cambodian Red Cross to spread the word about today's outreach. In the community where they live for the benefit of themselves, their families and the community.
At the same time, she also called on people from all walks of life to continue to donate materials and equipment to the Cambodian Red Cross so that the National Association has sufficient resources to continue to provide humanitarian services to help the most vulnerable and vulnerable. Currently.
