(Rattanakiri): Mr. Chiang Am, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Rattanakiri Provincial Party Working Group, announced the adjustment of the composition of the Provincial Party Working Group and the Party Working Group of Rattanakiri Province.
