Key Remarks by Samdech Mani Hun Manet on the Opening Ceremony of the 8th River Festival in Siem Reap
(Siem Reap): On the evening of Saturday, March 16, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the opening ceremony of the 8th River Festival in Phnom Penh, Cambodia. In Siem Reap.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Mani President Hun Manet's opportunity to open the 8th River Festival in Siem Reap:
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that under the wise leadership of Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, former Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, Cambodia has achieved unprecedented peace in the whole country. More than 500 years in history with development in all areas.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that with peace, Cambodia has become an attractive destination for tourism, investment and trade in Asia, especially making tourism an important driving force in the last 30 years. In contributing to the economic growth of Cambodia to increase about 13 times from 1993-2023.
* In connection with the Australian Prime Minister's Memorial on Angkor in 1987, President Hun Manet stated that in the past, Siem Reap did not have the bustle of tourism as it does today. This is the reward of peace.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that in the last decade, Cambodia's tourism sector has grown proudly, having contributed significantly to GDP. National. But this growth was almost entirely hampered by the spread of the 19-crisis Kovid crisis, which adversely affected public health and severely affected socio-economic development and international trade worldwide.
* Samdech Hun Manet said that during the 19-crisis Kovid Crisis, the Royal Government of the Sixth Legislature turned the crisis into an opportunity for the necessary rehabilitation and structural improvements to support the resumption of key tourism activities. Cambodia.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that for Siem Reap, the Royal Government has made strategic decisions to build a network of 38 roads and infrastructure, as well as to restore and improve the Siem Reap River, which has made Siem Reap more attractive. These new achievements are adding energy to the tourism industry in this glorious cultural and historical province.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government has launched the "Visit Siem Reap 2024" campaign and set 2024 as the year of people-to-people exchanges between Cambodia and China and the first Cambodia-India Tourism Year to Promote tourism in Siem Reap and help encourage potential tourists from both countries to visit Cambodia more.
* Samdech Hun Manet remains optimistic that tourism will remain an important economic sector in creating employment opportunities, employment, income and contributing to the achievement of the goals of the Pentagon Strategy - Phase 1, especially contributing to the achievement Vision Cambodia is a high middle income country by 2030 and a high income country by 2050.
* Samdech Hun Manet expressed his appreciation to the Ministry of Tourism under the leadership of HE Sok Soken, which for more than 6 months has been working to launch new strategic plans, especially the strategic initiative "increase 5 development 3" and direction. Some other sharp reforms.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet would like to request all relevant ministries and institutions to provide good cooperation with the Ministry of Tourism in order to achieve the above vision and promote the successful implementation of tourism-related initiatives.
* President Hun Manet stated that the development of riverine areas is not only for the present, but we need to think long-term into the future with a clear and comprehensive plan while the whole world And is facing new developments in politics, economy, society and the environment.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the development goal of the new government is not to abandon any citizen.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet agreed to set up annual events to attract tourists.
* President Hun Manet stated that the partnership between the state and the private sector must be strengthened to promote tourism activities in Cambodia.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet Welcoming at the airport is the first thing to attract tourists and can attract tourists.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet introduced the arrangement of Chai Yam music to welcome tourists at the airport to welcome tourists to visit Cambodia.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised to welcome Cambodian workers back from Thailand on the occasion of the New Year.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet encourages and provides 9 points of view to contribute to the promotion of tourism.
