The "Dragon in the Heart of Khmer" dance is a dance that focuses on the movement of the dragon, the cell division of the dragon, but the transformation of this ancient dance into a contemporary dance will need to be slightly modified. In each episode and in the lyrics and dance, but still retain the original journey of the dragon, the symbol of the year of the dragon, the Khmer tradition does not change.
The "Dragon in the Heart of Khmer" dance in the form of a contemporary dance will be filmed at the site of ancient Khmer temples and along the coast, which will show the true vitality of the soul of the dragon with the expectation that this creativity will give a new impression. Distinctive and become another new conservation culture of Khmer dance.
Ms. Thao Pich Amret stated that this contemporary dance will hopefully "help to enhance the prestige of Khmer culture, which is known as the Kingdom of the Goddess, the Goddess of the Dragon and the Goddess of Angkor" through the broadcast. To see the amazing views of tourist sites and important cultural sites in Cambodia.
On the morning of Sunday, March 17, 2024, the group "Apsara 25 Duong" will hold a ceremony to pay homage to the teacher, promote the work and Krong Pali, officially launch the recording of "Dragon in the Heart of Khmer" in the form of contemporary Khmer dance. This will be done at the Phnom Penh Gendarmerie Command before the official release of the video as a promotional video to celebrate the upcoming Khmer New Year.
