(Phnom Penh): At the Closing Ceremony of the Fire and Rescue Training Course for the Operation Search and Rescue Unit of the Army at the 70th Brigade Headquarters on the afternoon of March 15, 2024, General Mao Sophan Akka Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Commander of the Army, considered disaster management and relief a multi-faceted task.
General Mao Sophan emphasized that the new Royal Government under the leadership of Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this position will continue to be strengthened and implemented to meet the needs and real needs of the Cambodian people to continue to maintain and develop. Disaster resilience for the safety of villages, communes, sangkats, development of livelihoods and harmony in the community.
