Mr. Chea Somethy said this at the closing ceremony of the meeting to review the work results of 2023 and the work direction of 2024 of the Foundation for the Disabled, Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation on the afternoon of March 15, 2024.
