(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Duke Association on March 13, 2024 issued a press release on the recent publication on some social media related to the Duke in Cambodia, requesting individuals or media units to publish directly to the Duke. Who committed wrongdoing and should not associate those scandals with the title of general duke.
