Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet continued that for the amount of doctors, health centers have been pushed to the local level, but there are still a few communes in remote areas, but the Royal Government is examining to complete the steps, while the Royal Government is currently working hard. However, strengthen the quality of health rather than expansion. Many health officials are also recruited through competitions, as well as capacity building and incentives.
"Now we are putting in extra money to buy medicine that people need for high blood pressure, diabetes medicine to increase, now we can provide 5 days or a week, then the next day to increase the budget to Can guarantee to give him more than that, because he needs to last forever.
At the same time, Samdech President Hun Manet emphasized that the order of high blood pressure and diabetes medicine is to make it easier for the sick people not to travel far from the hospital too often while With some patients, they live far from the location of the drug for daily use.
Samdech Hun Sen emphasized that we need to strengthen what is targeted, so it is important that the medicine and medical equipment are good and high quality to the people. We can not abandon any citizen, everyone is the strength of the nation.
At this point, Samdech President Hun Manet added that if only modern medical equipment and equipment, but doctors do not know how to use it can not help treat people effectively.
This statement was made on the occasion that Samdech Hun Sen presided over the inauguration of "Techo Sen Koh Thom" Hospital in Koh Thom District, Kandal Province this morning, March 13, 2024.
"Some people keep asking that Cambodia only seeks to strengthen the health sector, why do so many Cambodians go for outpatient treatment? "Fewer local doctors treat millions of people a year."
