In addition, Samdech President Hun Manet said that he remembered that there was a young patient from a hospital in France who assessed less than 10 percent of the successful operation, but the doctors in Cambodia did so successfully. That Khmer doctors are bad.
Samdech Hun Manet said that the Korean volunteer doctors praised the Cambodian doctors' skills, saying that the Cambodian doctors were very skilled and lacked modern equipment like him, but in Cambodia there are also modern equipment. Many Koreans just do not have the latest gadgets.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that this is what the Royal Government has built medical expertise over the past 40 years, and is proud that the provision of services to 9 million people will be in the hands of those who have Ability to save lives, which is the army of the angels to save the lives of the people.
