(Oddar Meanchey): Trapeang Veng Dam, located in Trapeang Veng Village, Sangkat Kon Kreal, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province, which was damaged by floods during the previous rainy season, has been repaired by the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology.
Mr. Nhen Kuon, Director of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Department of Water Resources and Meteorology, said on March 12, 2024 that by following the instructions of Mr. Thor Chetha, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology and the guidance of Mr. Pen Kosal, Governor of Oddar Meanchey Province. Trapeang Veng Dam, damaged by floods, has been rehabilitated.
