This is not the first time that President Hun Manet has reacted to the Cambodia Daily Foreign Service's distorted broadcasts related to the Prek Chik Techo-Funan project, which has always claimed to have been sourced from senior ministry officials. Economy. The Cambodia Daily distorts that the Funan-Techo canal is a useless project and makes the government indebted.
Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet once said that Prek Chik Funan-Techo will be a service to the water transport sector from the river to the sea, create jobs and help lower transportation costs.
Please be informed that the Tonle Bassac Navigation Road and Logistics System Project was named "Prek Chik Funan Techo" Project at the Plenary Session of the 6th Legislative Council of the National Assembly on May 19, 2023. The Royal Government has decided to set up an inter-ministerial commission to implement this project.
The project will build three waterway dams, build 11 bridges, build a 208-kilometer sidewalk, and provide navigation assistance and other river-crossing infrastructure. The construction of the new waterway project is estimated to cost $ 1.7 billion and take about four years to complete.
On October 17, 2023, His Excellency Hun Manet presided over the signing ceremony of the framework agreement between the Council for the Development of Cambodia and representatives of the China Bridge and Road Corporation. CRBC) to pave the way for the company to study the project in detail in eight months. After eight months of study, negotiations are underway to sign a construction agreement.
Separately, for the construction project of the first phase of deep water container port at Sihanoukville Autonomous Port, worth $ 243 million, it is 350 meters long and the water depth is 14.5 meters. The container port will be able to accommodate container vessels with a capacity of 60,000 tons or 4,000 TEUs, with transit routes in the Asia-Pacific region to the Sihanoukville Autonomous Port, and will increase the total port capacity to approximately 1.25. Millions of TEUs per year.
