Analysis: China expands high level of foreign openness and boosts investment in China
Looking at the global framework, it can be seen that the current form of capital attraction is generally declining. Thus, all countries have increased the force of attracting traders and raising foreign capital. How will China attract and use foreign capital? How will China expand further? This year's Chinese government work report uses some "calculation" methods, sums and subtractions to provide its answers.
First, let's look at "addition". From expanding the list of industries that encourage foreign traders to invest to increasing the guarantee of investment services of foreign traders to improve the convenience for foreigners to work, study and travel, some service measures that are warm and The meticulousness facilitates the return of foreign traders and also provides an important guarantee for their investment and career.
The capital will follow the benefits. According to official Chinese statistics, in recent years, the rate of return on foreign direct investment in China by foreign business is about 9 percent, which is relatively high internationally. It is not difficult to see that choosing China makes foreign capital huge profits. This makes them maintain a strong momentum for investment in China.
