Take the opportunity to meet with trainees and officials of the Bodyguard Command Training Center (Phnom Srong) and to contribute to the realization of the political program and strategy of the Pentagon - Phase 1 of the Royal Government, the 7th legislature of the National Assembly and in accordance with the defense mission Defined by the Royal Government, the 7th legislature of the National Assembly, Lt. Gen. Dy Pov also set out five more principles for all participants to implement as follows:
* First, the army must be a highly professional army that is absolutely loyal to the motherland and the people and strictly respects all the provisions, circulars, rules, regulations, tactics, adheres to the traditions and dignity of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and becomes A real force to defend the motherland and the people.
* Second: All units must pay the utmost attention to the use of force, resources and assets of the unit to be stable and effective, that is, to use force in accordance with the needs of skills and to manage the maintenance of weapons, military equipment. Everything, as well as food, etc., properly and sustainably.
* Third: All units must strengthen training, learning and building human resources, both quantitatively and qualitatively, to serve the national defense effectively. In particular, all units need to strengthen the skills of the soldiers in accordance with the duties.
* Fourth: All units should pay attention to prepare all means and means to help rescue people in the event of an accident, with a proactive spirit and close cooperation with local authorities. And relevant ministries and institutions.
* Fifth, all units should encourage the building of the economy on the spot, such as: cultivation and animal husbandry, etc. to contribute to improving the livelihood of the army and family, ensure comfort, well-being and productivity in fulfilling their mission.
