On this sad occasion, my wife and I would like to express our deepest condolences and deepest condolences, for the death of His Excellency Chan Ven is the loss of a pious and pious husband and father. Companions of the armed struggle to liberate the nation from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and strive to sacrifice physical and mental resources to serve the cause of peace and development of the motherland.
