Mr. Chea Somethy: Women with disabilities have the courage to persevere, which is a testament for every woman to be a role model and learn to change negative attitudes towards women with disabilities
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chea Somethy, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, said that women with disabilities face many difficulties, but you have the courage, perseverance and high commitment, which is a testament for every woman in every world. A place to be a role model and learn to change negative attitudes towards women with disabilities.
The Minister made this remark when he met with a solidarity dinner with women with disabilities, cough and fitness on the occasion of the 113th Anniversary of International Women's Day, March 8, 2024 under the theme "Women And Girls in the Digital Revolution ”on March 8, 2024, organized by the Samneang Music Association for the Disabled.
"As your experience, your insights and views are invaluable, we all need to create a cohesive environment where your voices are heard and your talents are celebrated and appreciated," he said. Acknowledge.
