The Minister would like to thank Ms. Nhem Morakot, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Women's Affairs and Honorary President of the Samneang Music Association for the Disabled, and Mr. Chap To, Undersecretary of State and President of the Samneang Music Association for the Disabled, for initiating this event to encourage blind women. And Fitness and reported on efforts to promote gender equality in the association successfully over the past year.
