Mr. Seng Try, a student at Hun Sen Svay Chrum High School, said that I find this program very useful for the 12th grade students who are preparing for the high school diploma exam. Next, in other high schools throughout the Kingdom of Cambodia, please request to have such a program every year to apply for scholarships effectively, targeted and successful.
Mr. Sum Samnang, a student at Svay Rieng High School, said that today he and the three students learned about China and the opportunity to receive scholarships to study in China. I have heard it said today that I met the leaders of the student association in China. Especially know the source of scholarships in China to avoid being scammed by other companies or services that are dishonest.
Mr. Phuong Tola, a student at Hun Sen Prasot High School, said that this workshop is an important way to give us students the opportunity to prepare for scholarships to study in China after the 12th grade exam. We met face to face as speakers, A-level students and scholarship winners of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, Undergraduate level for the 2024 academic year, and shared their learning techniques and scholarship competitions.
