Duke Kith Meng tells Australian businessmen that Cambodia is a strategic channel for Australian businesses looking to expand their markets and supply chains.
(Phnom Penh): Duke Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and Chairman of the ASEAN Business Advisory Council for Cambodia, highlighted that Cambodia is a strategic channel for Australian businesses seeking to diversify global markets and improve supply chains. Because Cambodia has a wide network under the favorable framework of many trade agreements.
