"The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts must continue to cooperate with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, inspire all Cambodian embassies and consulates abroad to organize regular Cambodian cultural events every year to promote national culture with "Strengthening politics, culture, diplomacy and inspiring the Cambodian community abroad to participate in organizing the National Cultural Day in a grand and comprehensive manner."
