(Phnom Penh): Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council, stated that up to now, the Constitutional Council has 33 female civil servants, equivalent to 36.3% of the total number of civil servants. He said that in that 22 civil servants, equal to 66.67% of the total civil servants are women holding positions and positions from section chief to general director.
This is the morning of March 7, 2024, when the Honorary Legal Officer Dr. M. Chhun Lim presided over the celebration of the 113th anniversary of International Women's Day on March 8.
