(Kampot): The Governor of Kampot Province, Mr. Mao Thunin, told the people and the authorities to work together to preserve the natural resources, cultural heritage and ancestral heritage that have been left behind in Wat Sampov 5, some buildings and temples on Bokor Mountain. It is more than 100 years old and the great scenery and heritage are very valuable for the people and the next generation.
