The provincial governor also said that Cambodia is sheltered under the shadow of peace that Samdech Techo Hun Sen took his life to change and under the skillful leadership of Samdech Thep Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, the country has developed in all areas. Separately, for Kampot province, many achievements have been provided to the people to use, such as roads, bridges, schools, medical officers, beaches, and so on.
