Senior officials of the Ministry of Education appreciate the work of Islamic education and consider it an important contribution to the Royal Government
(Phnom Penh): On the evening of March 6, 2024, Dr. Nath Bunroeun, Representative of Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2015 General Conference on Islamic Education. -2023 and raise the direction of further work at the National Institute of Education.
At the closing ceremony of the General Assembly, Mr. Nou Sles said that as the organizing committee of the General Assembly was very pleased and mentioned the process of the General Assembly to summarize the results of Islamic education in 2015 2023. And the direction of further work under the theme of Islamic education reform in the digital context has been successfully carried out for two days.
The General Assembly Organizing Committee has organized a number of accompanying events, such as an exhibition showcasing the achievements of Islamic education, a cabinet composition competition (Friday speech), national winners, and a nationwide school selection evaluation.
