Kim Jong Un's visit to the base, whose name and location have not been confirmed, comes after the United States and South Korea began annual joint military exercises on the 4th. March in South Korea, and the joint military exercise doubled the number of troops participating in the exercise last year.
According to the KCNA, Kim Jong Un said that the North Korean military must strengthen and increase the highest level of war alert in line with the need to control the situation. "Our troops must ... increase practical warfare exercises in order to rapidly improve their combat capabilities for perfect war alert," Kim added.
