The Dental Association of Cambodia organizes the 22nd Cambodia Dental Exhibition to provide sustainable knowledge training every year to dentists.
(Phnom Penh): The Dental Association of Cambodia has organized the 22nd Cambodian Dental Conference and Exhibition under the theme "Continuous Development of the Global Dental Sector" to provide sustainable knowledge training every year to dentists.
The 22nd Cambodian Dental Conference and Exhibition was organized by Dr. Sik Bonna, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, Mr. Soeung Kimsan, President of the Cambodian Dental Association, on March 6, 2024.
Dr. Sik Bonna stated that the conference and exhibition was organized by the Dental Association of Cambodia and the World Dental Federation (FDI) and with the support of member companies. Solidarity, good cooperation and proper implementation of education and training to sustain knowledge every year for dentists in Cambodia.
"Oral health is an important part of everyone's general health, good oral health, economic growth, family and society have grown better and can contribute to the development of the country, if not oral health," he said. Good leads to loss of time, money, wealth and many other benefits.
Mr. Soeung Kimsan stated that the 22nd Annual Conference and Dental Exhibition of the Cambodian Dental Association 2024 was also attended by famous national and international speakers, national and international trainees, as well as representatives of 39 companies participating in the Dental Exhibition. The company has a total of 92 booths.
