The President of the National Assembly of France highly appreciates the participation of National Assembly President Khuon Sodary in the Summit of the Speaker of the Women's Parliament in the French Republic to protect the global interests of women
(Paris): Ms. Yaël Braun-Pivet, President of the National Assembly of the French Republic, expressed her appreciation and appreciation for the official visit of National Assembly President Khuon Sodary, President of the National Assembly of Cambodia to the French Republic. Participate in the Summit of Women Speakers hosted by the French Parliament in order to mobilize the voice of women to protect the interests of women around the world.
This was stated by the President of the French National Assembly during a bilateral meeting with the President of the National Assembly of Cambodia on the evening of March 5, 2024 at the French National Assembly in Paris.
The President of the National Assembly and the President of the French National Assembly expressed their pleasure to see that the relations and cooperation between Cambodia and France have been steadily developing in both the legislative and executive branches.
The National Assembly stressed the importance of Cambodia-France bilateral cooperation not only to benefit both countries and peoples, but also to contribute to maintaining the principles of multilateralism and promoting the dialogue mechanism. Peace, social stability to the people of the world, while the world today is in a state of uncertainty, rapid change and the outbreak of war in some regions.
