(Battambang): The Battambang Provincial Administration, together with the wives of provincial leaders, departments and nearly 400 civil servants of the Armed Forces, gathered on the morning of March 6, 2024 to organize a get-together to celebrate the 113th anniversary. International Women March 8, 2024 under the theme "Women and girls in the digital revolution".
