Senior Minister Ly Thuch believes that the Mine Action Authority and GICHD will make significant strides towards freeing Cambodia from the threat of landmines and explosive remnants of war and making all communities safer and more prosperous. At the same time, this commitment is a joint venture towards a future where the world is free of landmines.
